{
    "title": "Millionaire 2024 - Trivia Game",
    "description": "Millionaire 2024 - Trivia Quiz + Offline Games is:\r\n- ability to play with friends\r\n- online highscores\r\n- offline trivia game to test your IQ and general knowledge\r\n- source of valuable and little-known information\r\n- entertaining questions for all categories of interest\r\n- a great opportunity to challenge your friends and other players for top ranks\r\n- delightful learning experience whether you know the answers or not\r\n\r\nDo you know what color is a mirror? White, green or silver? Download and find out answer on this and other interesting questions.\r\n\r\nMillionaire Offline Trivia Quiz Game -  is a Logic Brain Game. Questions & Answers - general knowledge trivia is a very interesting and popular trivia game. In this game you can proof that you are clever and train your brain! Choose the correct answer from 4 possible ones. Tons of questions are waiting.\r\n\r\nTake part in online leaderboards. Million is virtual, but you knowledge is real!  By playing this game you will earn general knowledge. Millionaire Offline Trivia Quiz general knowledge lets you experience the thrilling excitement of fighting for the grand prize of one million through 15 challenging trivia puzzles. Game is ready for all world languages.\r\n\r\nIf you don't know answer then don't worry we will help you by help options. So you can keep learning in our trivia game. Our main aim is play & learn.\r\n\r\nQuestions:\r\n- all questions are filtered by difficulty. The more questions you answer, the more difficult questions you get.\r\n- you get more in-game money for difficult questions. Last and most difficult questions will bring you million. More millions - upper rank in millionaire leaderboard.\r\n\r\nHelp options:\r\n- remove 2 wrong answers\r\n- ask audience\r\n- ask einstein\r\n- replace question\r\n\r\nTrivia game is available offline. No need to wait download and enjoy Millionaire OfflineTrivia Quiz BrainGame now!\r\nCompete with your friends in order to win millions!\r\nProve your friends that you are the winner of Millionaire Trivia Quiz - Logic Brain Game!\r\nOnline millionaires leaderboard!\r\nIt is the best quiz game available so far. \r\nBest Trivia Quiz Game for the whole world. Play & Improve your general knowledge. Challenge game.\r\nEnjoy the Millionaire: Trivia Quiz Logic Game. Good luck! Be a star, trivia star!\r\n\r\nNote: We don't offer real cash through this game.",
